OL,3,GNEWSACyclist killed in crash near car
OL,4,Aplant
OL,5,
OL,6,FA cyclist has been killed in a crash on
OL,7,Fa road close to a major car plant.
OL,9,FThe bike was in a crash with a black
OL,10,FMercedes AMG car on Nissan Way, in
OL,11,FWashington, shortly before 01:00 BST on
OL,12,FFriday.
OL,14,FA man in his 50s who had been riding
OL,15,Fthe bicycle was declared dead at the
OL,16,Fscene and officers from Northumbria
OL,17,FPolice arrested a 30-year-old man on
OL,18,Fsuspicion of causing death by dangerous
OL,19,Fdriving. He has since been released
OL,20,Funder investigation.
OL,23,APub: 11-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,400,390,260,160,0,100
