OL,3,GNEWSACyclist killed in crash near car
OL,4,Aplant
OL,5,
OL,6,FSgt Greg Huntley appealed for witnesses
OL,7,For anyone with footage of the area
OL,8,Fclose to the Nissan car plant, taken
OL,9,Faround the time of the crash, to come
OL,10,Fforward.
